If the file starts with
    - c, then the data is clean
    - r, then the data is raw

Clean Trait Data
    - c_TRY_angio_traits_v1.csv : subset version of TRY data where 
        - only angiosperms are selected
        - relevant columns selected in 260812_TRY_cleaning.R originally
        - needed traits to be cleaned further
    - c_TRY_angio_traits_v2.csv : fully cleaned version of above
        - cleaned in 260826_TRY_df_exploration.R
        - clean format and trait names
        - in the MAIN column order and format !!
    - c_top30genera_ls.txt : list of the top 30 genera represented in the binded trait df
        - created in 260901_trait_data_merge.R
    - c_try_angio_filt_out.csv : list of data that was requested from TRY that was not included in v1 one above
        - categorical traits and some other information associated with observations such as lat/long/alt
        - was moved to local computer folder since cannot be accessed via GitHub

Other data that is cleaned that is not stored here:
- FIA_combined.csv : stored locally on iMac in Documents>Data>FIA; 
    - file size is too large to be supported by GitHub; 
    - data from FIA MN_TREE.csv and MD_TREE.csv